天下最幸福的白痴。她已经没有心思去思考孩子是怎么来的了，只想好好地将他生下来。可是，她突然停下脚步，紧皱眉头，前些天吃了兔子肉，孩子会不会三瓣嘴？一天三顿糊弄的吃食，孩子会不会营养不良？昨天还剧烈运动来着，会不会有不好的影响？越想她的心情越复杂。不会的，不会的，她战轻狂的孩子没有那么脆弱的。恩，她心中不断给自己打气，接着又傻呵呵的直乐，路上的人都异样的看着她。“宝宝，今天有没有吃饱饱啊！”“宝宝要乖乖听话啊！”“宝宝……”每天战轻狂都乐此不疲的和她的宝宝对话，轻轻地抚摸她的肚子。三个月的时候，她身体里的灵力还可以在灵基中汇聚成团，停留其中；五个月的时候，灵力已经不能在灵基中停留了，直接就被吸收了；七个月的时候，她觉得她的身体就像个媒介，连接在孩子和生命元素之间的桥梁，孩子疯狂的吸收着，每次生命元素都撑得她经脉生疼，全身无力。这天，战轻狂就像是刚从水里打捞出来一样，脸色苍白，浑身是汗，似责备的拍拍肚子，宠溺的说道：“真是贪吃的小家伙儿，妈妈都快疼死了，你乖乖的，妈妈要出去一下。”吃了个生命果，补充一下体力，战轻狂离开生命空间，出现在山洞里，好长时间没出来看看了，不知道她的菜，东西什么的有没有被其他动物弄乱。挺着腰，她艰难的出去查看。“吼”的一声引起她的注意，好像是有野兽打斗的声音，本来她是不想理会的，可是想到它们要是打到自己家门口的时候，把自己的菜都踩坏了，那她就没有吃的了。拿起匕首，隐蔽的向着打斗的场地走去。找到一颗大树藏好，战轻狂看着眼前的局面，是两只豹子在打斗，旁边还有一只小豹子蹒跚着，不断发出像小猫似的叫声。动物界中，猫科动物中的雄性要是追求配偶，想交/配，而雌性动物身边还有小兽的时候，雄兽都是将小兽咬死，这样雌兽才会重新去交/配，重新生育。显然，现在母豹子正为了保护自己的孩子和公豹子在撕咬着，看样子小豹子出生还没有几天，而两者力量的不同导致母豹子身上已经有好多伤口了。救还是不救？看着母豹子低吼一声又冲了上去，她决定还是救，一部分原因是被母豹子所感动，另一部分原因是，她现在太小了，勉强怀孕已经不易，也不知道这个年龄有没有水，要是没有，她的孩子吃什么，而现在，这母豹子显然是在哺乳期，那就救了它，给她的孩子当妈。捡起身边的几个石子，运用暗劲招招打向公豹子的眼睛，使得母豹子得以喘息，被惹火的公豹子向着她藏身的大树冲来，握紧手中的匕首，战轻狂等着给它致命一击，左手飞射出石子干扰它，右手将匕首当做暗器，插进公豹子的左前肢上，呜呜两声，公豹子不甘的瞪了她两眼，狼狈逃窜。将公豹子打跑，战轻狂往前两步，和冲她低吼的母豹子对峙，看着它防备的看着自己，她尽量释放自己的善意，站在它五步远的地方不动了，含笑看着它。许久过去，母豹子发现似乎眼前的人对自己没有恶意，走向它的孩子，不停凋着。“过来，过来。”招招手，战轻狂也不知道它能不能理解自己的意思，却发现它只是看着自己两眼，一下子咬住小豹子的脖子，叼住后，一瘸一拐的向她走来。见它明白了，战轻狂想摸摸她，觉得还是算了，就带着它向自己的山洞中走去。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Walking on the noisy streets, people are still talking about the mysterious deaths of the sons of several families in neighboring Xiangcheng. Zhan Qingkuang asked around and found an inconspicuous medical clinic. Rich people bought expensive elixirs, but those without money could only go to the medical clinic for treatment, and those who couldn't even go to a medical clinic had to find some herbs to cook and drink. Unfortunately, Zhan Qingkuang is now poor. He pulled down the hat on his cloak, covering most of his face, before entering this medical clinic with little business. \"See a doctor or get medicine?\" The doctor sitting in the hall was a bit indifferent, and a little medicine boy next to him was sorting out herbal medicine. \"See a doctor.\" She raised her hand and saw the doctor stroking his beard nervously. After a while, he told her a big thunderbolt from the blue. \"Congratulations, madam, you are very happy.\" What the hell? pregnant? Pregnant? Just kidding! \"Are you kidding me?\" Zhan Qingkuang asked in disbelief. The doctor was a little contemptuous when he heard that the voice was a young one. Huh, I didn't learn well at a young age, hung out with men, and got pregnant. \"Believe it or not, I have been running this medical clinic for 20 years, and the pulse is not wrong.\" Noticing that the doctor was a little unhappy, Zhan Qingkuang thought that there was no truth to what he said, but she had never had a man, so how could she have a child? Suddenly, an idea flashed, that man! \"How long?\" \"Almost two months. Really, at such a young age...\" She could no longer hear what the doctor said. Two months, he was really the man who left after eating. But, kids? Throwing down the crystal coins, Zhan Qingkuang walked away lightly. She was frightened by the surprise! The child who had no destiny in her previous life, the child who was poached by her elder brother, the child who was frivolous and frivolous, now there is a little life in her belly, a child that will slowly grow up, a child that can call her mother, a child with her blood. Thinking of this, she smiled stupidly for the first time, like an idiot, the happiest idiot in the world. She no longer had the time to think about how the child came to be, she just wanted to give birth to him properly. However, she suddenly stopped and frowned. After eating rabbit meat a few days ago, would the child have a three-petal mouth? Will the child become malnourished if he eats three meals a day? I exercised strenuously yesterday. Will it have any negative effects? The more I thought about her, the more complicated my mood became. No, no, she is not that vulnerable to frivolous children. Well, she kept cheering herself up in her heart, and then she felt silly and happy. People on the road looked at her strangely. \"Baby, have you eaten enough today!\" \"Baby, please be obedient!\" \"Baby...\" Zhan Qingkuang enjoys talking to her baby every day and gently caressing her belly. At three months, the spiritual power in her body could still gather into a ball in the spiritual base and stay there; at five months, the spiritual power could no longer stay in the spiritual base and was directly absorbed; at seven months, she felt that her body was like a medium, a bridge between the child and the life elements. The child was absorbing it crazily, and every time the life elements were stretched, her meridians ached and her whole body was weak. On this day, Zhan Qingkuang looked as if he had just been fished out of the water. His face was pale and covered with sweat. He patted his belly reproachfully and said dotingly: \"You are such a greedy little guy. Mom is almost in pain. You must be good. Mom has to go out for a while.\" After eating a life fruit to replenish his strength, Zhan Qingkuang left the life space and appeared in the cave. He hadn't come out to see her for a long time. I don't know if her food or other things were messed up by other animals. Straightening her back, she went out to check with difficulty. A \"roar\" caught her attention. It seemed like the sound of wild beasts fighting. She didn't want to pay attention to it at first, but she thought that if they came to her door and trampled all her vegetables, she would have nothing to eat. Picking up the dagger, he walked towards the fighting venue in a hidden way. After finding a big tree to hide, Zhan Qingkuang looked at the situation in front of him. There were two leopards fighting, and there was a little leopard staggering next to him, constantly making sounds like a kitten. In the animal kingdom, if a male of the cat family pursues a mate and wants to mate, and when a female animal has a baby next to her, the male will bite the baby to death so that the female can mate and give birth again. Obviously, the female leopard is currently biting the male leopard to protect her cub. It seems that the baby leopard has only been born for a few days, and the difference in strength between the two has caused many wounds on the female leopard's body. To save or not to save? Seeing the female leopard growl and charge forward again, she decided to save it. Partly because she was moved by the female leopard, and partly because she was too young now. It was not easy to get pregnant. She didn't know if there was water at this age. If not, what would her child eat? And now, the female leopard was obviously lactating, so she should save it and become a mother for her child. Picking up a few stones around him, he hit the male leopard in the eyes with his secret power, allowing the female leopard to breathe. The enraged male leopard rushed towards the big tree where she was hiding, holding the dagger in his hand. Zhan Qingkuang waited for a fatal blow. He shot out stones with his left hand to interfere with it. He used the dagger as a hidden weapon with his right hand and inserted it into the male leopard's left forelimb. After whining twice, the male leopard glared at her unwillingly and ran away in embarrassment. After beating the male leopard away, Zhan Qingkuang took two steps forward to confront the female leopard who was growling at her. Seeing it looking at her defensively, she tried her best to release her kindness and stood five steps away from it without moving, looking at it with a smile. After a long time, the female leopard realized that the person in front of her didn't seem to have any ill intentions towards her, so she walked towards her child and kept wilting. \"Come here, come here.\" He waved, Zhan Qingkuang didn't know if it could understand what he meant, but found that it just looked at him and bit the little leopard's neck.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}